ve, that's awesome! Doing something you love and helping others is so rewarding. Keep up the great work!\n[S4T22] (dia_id: D4:22)\n\nDave: Thanks, Cal! I really appreciate the boost. It means a lot that my work is valued and that it brings joy to others.\n[S4T23] (dia_id: D4:23)\n\nCalvin: Glad to help, Dave! So awesome to see you doing your thing and making a difference. Your hard work and talent totally deserve all the recognition. Keep on keepin' on, bud! Take a look at this beautiful necklace with a diamond pendant, that's so stunning!\n[Image caption: a photo of a gold necklace with a diamond pendant]\n[S4T24] (dia_id: D4:24)\n\nDave: Wow, that's a great necklace! Where did you get it?\n[S4T25] (dia_id: D4:25)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I got it from another artist as a gift - it's a great reminder of why I keep hustling as a musician!\n[S4T26] (dia_id: D4:26)\n\nDave: Awesome, Calvin! Keep pushing and making music, it'll remind us why we keep hustling.\n[S4T27] (dia_id: D4:27)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, Dave! The road can be hard, but when we remember why we're doing it, it keeps us going. Let's keep each other motivated!\n[S4T28] (dia_id: D4:28)","text_sha256":"f07a539adf2efb700f9e314e961d062f9723f5d46cd451ce0247f7fbd1fc721e","timestamp":"2023-05-01T18:24:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","pre_tree_sha256":"e9b96bcd4e036f4ea4599edb06e9c0527c929442b09efe05d09ea416b8a4469d","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":338,"filesystem_tool_calls":0,"model_calls":4,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":13175,"provider_request_attempts":4,"provider_rounds":4,"token_usage_available":true,"total_tokens":13513},"model":{"requested_model":"x-test-2","served_models":["deepseek-v4.1-flash"]},"prompt_contract":{"derived_prompt_sha256":"6930d93099ac20b76e881b68cbb63b46e1a0a3e2ff43453db685551c3339a6dc","filesystem_tools_sha256":"98017e74a12c2eec4f0139c484d2d6bd809e4f37a8f96c7f419dc959156